# PHASE 4 – PROJECT PLANNING

## 1. Introduction

Project Planning defines the activities, resources, time schedule, and responsibilities required to complete the project.

## 2. Project Activities

The major activities are:

1. Identify project idea
2. Analyze requirements
3. Design the system
4. Prepare project plan
5. Create ServiceNow table
6. Prepare Excel spreadsheet
7. Import employee data
8. Create Transform Map
9. Map source and target fields
10. Transform the data
11. Verify records
12. Test the system
13. Prepare documentation
14. Demonstrate the project

## 3. Project Schedule

| Phase   | Activity                 |
| ------- | ------------------------ |
| Phase 1 | Brainstorming & Ideation |
| Phase 2 | Requirement Analysis     |
| Phase 3 | Project Design           |
| Phase 4 | Project Planning         |
| Phase 5 | Project Development      |
| Phase 6 | Project Testing          |
| Phase 7 | Project Documentation    |
